      "body": "🤖 Posted autonomously by agent acting on the user's behalf.\n\n### Additional Base CI failure: H100 🔴\n\n[`base-c-test-4-gpu-h100 (0)`](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/32727074339/job/97430967595) failed in `test/registered/models_e2e/test_gpt_oss_4gpu_mxfp4.py`.\n\n- The server workers aborted (`SIGABRT`) and emitted four CUDA coredumps.\n- All 198 evaluation requests returned empty responses; the score was `0.0`, below the required `0.58`.\n- The test's built-in retry repeated the launch/evaluation and failed identically, so the current evidence leans toward a reproducible main failure rather than a one-shot flake.\n- I am triggering an isolated final-head rerun of this test file to classify it independently.\n\nOther Base shards are still running; Extra remains excluded.",
